Another thing is, say if I reset my computer, okay, nothing's open, then that's probably when it would be harder for you to find the models for the other computer. Once they open the app, they don't have to open a whole bunch of different CLIs. All they have to do is open the app and it automatically opens and finds all the CLIs. Once they close the app from there, it just runs in the background and then people can just use their Codex or other LLMs.

That's what I want to add. =

